## PHASE 3 — PLATFORM ADMINISTRATION AND USER ACCESS MANAGEMENT

Build the first genuinely operational admin module.

### Required capabilities

- Search and view users.
- View account status.
- View assigned platform roles.
- View organisation memberships.
- View relevant verification status.
- Suspend or reactivate accounts where supported by the approved policy.
- Assign and revoke approved roles.
- Review role-change history.
- Review administrator access history.
- View permission summaries.
- Enforce least privilege.

### Safety controls

- No self-escalation.
- No unauthorized super-admin assignment.
- No silent role changes.
- No client-side role writes.
- No direct table updates bypassing protected operations.
- No deletion of important audit records.
- Require an explicit reason for sensitive administrative actions.
- Require appropriate confirmation for high-impact operations.
- Record the real authenticated actor.

If a feature cannot be implemented securely, show it as unavailable instead of simulating success.

