Build platform-level governance of organisations without confusing it with organisation-level administration.

### Platform administrator capabilities

- View organisations.
- Review organisation submissions.
- Verify organisation information.
- Approve, reject or suspend organisations under an explicit policy.
- Inspect organisation membership and role assignments.
- Review organisation activity.
- Investigate cross-tenant security incidents.
- Review ownership changes.
- Review organisation verification history.

### Organisation administrator capabilities

- Manage only their organisation.
- Invite and manage permitted members.
- Assign only allowed organisation roles.
- Manage organisation-owned listings.
- View their own organisation's audit history.
- Never access another organisation's private records.
- Never grant platform-wide roles.

