- Enforce tenant boundaries in database policies and functions.
- Validate resource ownership on every write.
- Prevent arbitrary organisation ID substitution.
- Secure invitation acceptance and token handling.
- Bind invitation acceptance to the intended recipient.
- Prevent expired or reused invitations.
- Audit membership and ownership changes.

Do not activate paid subscriptions or billing.

