## FINAL DIRECTIVE

Build KhelGrid's Admin Control Center as a secure platform-governance system, not a collection of attractive dashboard screens.

Security, correct authorization, tenant isolation, truthful data, traceable actions and recoverability take priority over speed and visual completeness.

The first deliverable is a verified, secure Phase 1 foundation. Every later capability must build on that foundation and pass its own acceptance gate.